Data (results_all/, results_vocab/, meta/, and the intermediate_data.zip release asset)

These files are derived from the Stack Exchange data dumps (April 2024 and
September 2023), whose content is licensed by Stack Exchange Inc. and its
users under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike (CC BY-SA 2.5, 3.0 and
4.0, by posting date). The derived files are released under the Creative
Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/). Attribution: Stack Exchange
Inc. and the authors of the posts on the Stack Exchange network
(https://stackexchange.com). The files contain counts and word frequencies
and no post text.

The paper in paper/ is (c) 2026 Fengming Liu, under the license chosen at
arXiv:2611.15172.
